      "code": "# Adapted from nibzard/ai-sandbox-benchmark, Apache-2.0.\n# Source revision and modifications are recorded in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.\ndef calculate_primes():\n    primes = []\n    num = 2\n    while len(primes) < 10:\n        is_prime = True\n        for i in range(2, int(num**0.5) + 1):\n            if num % i == 0:\n                is_prime = False\n                break\n        if is_prime:\n            primes.append(num)\n        num += 1\n    return {'primes': primes, 'sum': sum(primes), 'average': sum(primes) / len(primes)}\n\ncalculate_primes()\n",
